      "why": "The receipt shape in fleet/CONTRACT.md and fleet/facts-block.mjs requires paths to be non-empty for a row to be a receipt at all; M2/M3 draw their paths from the exam landings, which are empty for a task whose Proof names no exam, and a row that silently stopped being a receipt would drop out of every judge's FACTS block with nothing to show for it."
